#%PAM-1.0
# MiOS native RDP server (mios-rdp-priv): password check of the Client Info credentials. No session
# phase: the session is the operator's own live one (as in xrdp gateway mode). Per-source exponential
# backoff is enforced in mios-rdp-server (auth.rs). Membership of the managed group mios-rdp
# ([remote.rdp].allowed_users, set by `mios-rdp render`) is checked here and again in mios-rdp-priv;
# root is refused in both.
auth       include      password-auth
account    required     pam_succeed_if.so user ingroup mios-rdp
account    required     pam_succeed_if.so uid >= 1000 quiet
account    include      password-auth
